{"3533010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sphenoid", "steam_appid": 3533010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in your cell on the same night <strong>The Warlock is executed in the electric chair</strong>. Before dying, he said he would take everyone with him… except the one who had <strong>this strange object</strong>. Did he keep his promise? Will you survive the horrors unleashed after his death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sphenoid</strong> is a horror escape room game set in a prison full of secrets. Solve puzzles, find clues, and discover what happened to the other prisoners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines <strong>dark, oppressive atmosphere</strong>, <strong>challenging puzzles</strong>, and an immersive story. Every corner of the prison hides secrets… and dangers that will test your wits and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expertly designed puzzles:</strong> Every challenge is logical, satisfying, and challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and discovery:</strong> Roam the prison, open cells, access secret areas, and find hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive story:</strong> Uncover what happened to the other prisoners and unravel the mysteries of the prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying atmosphere:</strong> Flickering lights, haunting shadows, and eerie sounds create constant tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the prison</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35